    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/dlc/ep2/travel/dlc_ep2_travel_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "Traveling to [TravelPlan.GetData.GetNextDestination.GetProvince.GetName] [SelectLocalization( TravelPlan.GetData.GetActivity.IsValid , 'TRAVEL_PLAN_TOOLTIP_ACTIVITY_DESC', '' )]\\n$BULLET_WITH_TAB$Current Location: [TravelPlan.GetData.GetCurrentLocation.GetName]\\n$BULLET_WITH_TAB$Estimated Arrival: [TravelPlan.GetData.GetNextDestination.GetEstimatedArrivalDate.GetTimeDiffFromNow]\\n\\n[SelectLocalization( TravelPlan.GetData.GetTravelLeader.IsValid, 'TRAVEL_PLAN_TOOLTIP_LEADER_DESC', '')]@travel_speed_icon! [TravelPlan.GetData.GetSpeedMultiplierAsPercentage]% [travel_speed|E]\\n@travel_safety_icon! [TravelPlan.GetData.GetSafetyValue|0] [travel_safety|E]",
    "RUS": "Путешествие во владение [TravelPlan.GetData.GetNextDestination.GetProvince.GetName][SelectLocalization( TravelPlan.GetData.GetActivity.IsValid , 'TRAVEL_PLAN_TOOLTIP_ACTIVITY_DESC', '' )]\\n$BULLET_WITH_TAB$Текущее местоположение: [TravelPlan.GetData.GetCurrentLocation.GetName]\\n$BULLET_WITH_TAB$Ожидаемое время прибытия: [TravelPlan.GetData.GetNextDestination.GetEstimatedArrivalDate.GetTimeDiffFromNow]\\n\\n[SelectLocalization( TravelPlan.GetData.GetTravelLeader.IsValid, 'TRAVEL_PLAN_TOOLTIP_LEADER_DESC', '')]@travel_speed_icon! [TravelPlan.GetData.GetSpeedMultiplierAsPercentage]% [travel_speed|E]\\n@travel_safety_icon! [TravelPlan.GetData.GetSafetyValue|0] [travel_safety|E]",
    "POL": "W podróży do miejsca znanego jako [TravelPlan.GetData.GetNextDestination.GetProvince.GetName] [SelectLocalization( TravelPlan.GetData.GetActivity.IsValid , 'TRAVEL_PLAN_TOOLTIP_ACTIVITY_DESC', '' )]\\n$BULLET_WITH_TAB$Obecne miejsce: [TravelPlan.GetData.GetCurrentLocation.GetName]\\n$BULLET_WITH_TAB$Przewidywane przybycie: [TravelPlan.GetData.GetNextDestination.GetEstimatedArrivalDate.GetTimeDiffFromNow]\\n\\n[SelectLocalization( TravelPlan.GetData.GetTravelLeader.IsValid, 'TRAVEL_PLAN_TOOLTIP_LEADER_DESC', '')]@travel_speed_icon! [TravelPlan.GetData.GetSpeedMultiplierAsPercentage]% [travel_speed|El]\\n@travel_safety_icon! [TravelPlan.GetData.GetSafetyValue|0] [travel_safety|El]",
